    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nerds and Ammo is a first-person puzzle shooter where brainpower meets firepower (and parenting).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/b320adbaeb16cab0f523df5035f99139.poster.avif?t=1755106644\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/b320adbaeb16cab0f523df5035f99139.webm?t=1755106644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/b320adbaeb16cab0f523df5035f99139.mp4?t=1755106644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Dr. Isaac Screwit or Dr. Roxy Volt, two eccentric scientists and proud co-owners of Nerdcore Labs. During a long weekend experiment \u2014 featuring questionable safety protocols and their unattended 10-year-old son \u2014 the facility\u2019s lockdown system is accidentally triggered, sealing every exit and activating a gauntlet of self-testing puzzle chambers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/843dfc9bd9202129f4fa061399ddf6dd.poster.avif?t=1755106644\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/843dfc9bd9202129f4fa061399ddf6dd.webm?t=1755106644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/843dfc9bd9202129f4fa061399ddf6dd.mp4?t=1755106644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you\u2019re stuck in your own lab with only a glorified science cannon, some suspiciously unstable gadgets, and your son Kevin at the control panel trying to \u201chelp.\u201d If you want out, you'll need to bounce, blast, and brute-force your way through physics puzzles, malfunctioning traps, laser grids, water hazards, and the growing fear that your security footage is still rolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/70143f8ca081343c2e556d9d2797ce6c.poster.avif?t=1755106644\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/70143f8ca081343c2e556d9d2797ce6c.webm?t=1755106644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/70143f8ca081343c2e556d9d2797ce6c.mp4?t=1755106644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something weird is definitely going on in here \u2014 and it's not just your aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-lethal weaponry, maximum chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch bounce pads, sticky blobs, and other barely-approved inventions to manipulate the environment and confuse physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two playable scientists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose Dr. Isaac Screwit or Dr. Roxy Volt \u2014 each with their own personality and fully voiced sarcasm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape your own test chambers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate puzzles, dodge hazards, and try to remember why you installed so many turrets in the first place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystery... somewhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange signals. Locked doors. Surveillance eyes. There\u2019s probably a plot here \u2014 but first, more puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like clever puzzles, chaotic gadgets, and science gone mildly wrong, Nerds and Ammo is ready to test you \u2014 whether you're ready or not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/8920a87138ff6654986d796263c7cc5b.poster.avif?t=1755106644\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/8920a87138ff6654986d796263c7cc5b.webm?t=1755106644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/8920a87138ff6654986d796263c7cc5b.mp4?t=1755106644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
