re\u2019s probably a plot here \u2014 but first, more puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like clever puzzles, chaotic gadgets, and science gone mildly wrong, Nerds and Ammo is ready to test you \u2014 whether you're ready or not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/8920a87138ff6654986d796263c7cc5b.poster.avif?t=1755106644\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/8920a87138ff6654986d796263c7cc5b.webm?t=1755106644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/8920a87138ff6654986d796263c7cc5b.mp4?t=1755106644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
